  "text_pages": [
    "GACHON UNIVERSITY - Course Registration\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nYou can register for up to 18 credits. ( Master's students may take up to 9 credits.)\nOnly Students with language qualifications can take major courses.\nOhterwise, take one designated elecive course in addtion to the Korean language courses.\nBachelor's and master's courses cannot be taken simultaneously.\nChoose Courses you want to take through the distributed course list nad course finder.\nRegister by the deadline through the link that will be provided later.\nTake the courses you have been chosen for the first week, and you can change them within the period that will be announced later.\nFor the course schedule, please refer to the Course Finder linked below.\nhttps://info.gachon.ac.kr/ssu/showTimetable.do\nChoose the one you want to see from the drop-down menu. e.g. '전공' (Major), '교양'(Elective).\nFor most elective courses are in  '교양' & '가천리버럴아츠칼리지\".\nYou can view the course syllabus by clicking on the course code.\nFor English taught major courses such as Business and Computer Engineering, please refer to the google sheets attached below.\n2025 Spring Course List\n2025 Fall Course List\n2026 Spring Course list\n2026 Fall Course List\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
  ],
